{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10642020","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10642020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1064202001:1":{"text":"该死的……又是这个梦。","source_cn":"该死的……又是这个梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBF1879952F12207","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064202002:1":{"text":"周而复始的噩梦……埃因再熟悉不过。他祈祷着自己能马上清醒。","source_cn":"周而复始的噩梦……埃因再熟悉不过。他祈祷着自己能马上清醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE341152642B969C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064202003:1":{"text":"要不了多久，迈克尔又会在梦中出现，摇晃他，呼唤他，直到魔物猖狂的笑声袭来——","source_cn":"要不了多久，迈克尔又会在梦中出现，摇晃他，呼唤他，直到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB28D45366C9F7D55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064202004:0":{"text":"大哥哥……大哥哥……","source_cn":"大哥哥……大哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42A7AF87F7928FFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064202005:0":{"text":"你怎么躺在这里？","source_cn":"你怎么躺在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5CE402E9D61A845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064202006:1":{"text":"谁？！","source_cn":"谁？！<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C467C04CB9C8CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064202007:1":{"text":"埃因猛地撑开眼睛。清冷的月光下，有个小女孩正站在一旁，俯身看向自己。","source_cn":"埃因猛地撑开眼睛。清冷的月光下，有个小女孩正站在一旁，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x518B6716EB284608","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064202008:1":{"text":"小女孩怀着还抱着一只造型奇特的……独角兽玩偶。","source_cn":"小女孩怀着还抱着一只造型奇特的……独角兽玩偶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF161A4A01DF41B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064202009:0":{"text":"对不起……我吓到你了？","source_cn":"对不起……我吓到你了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x407FEEA33F41A4DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064202010:1":{"text":"……没有。","source_cn":"……没有。<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB37902081C3C2CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064202011:1":{"text":"能听到炮火声……小姑娘，你为什么一个人待在这里？这里很危险。","source_cn":"能听到炮火声……小姑娘，你为什么一个人待在这里？这里很危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD0B9482FEDDBFA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064202012:1":{"text":"嗯……我知道。","source_cn":"嗯……我知道。<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F3AD36DD10BB115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064202013:1":{"text":"远处在打仗，魔……唔，那些可怕的怪物，随时可能入侵村子……","source_cn":"远处在打仗，魔……唔，那些可怕的怪物，随时可能入侵村子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51B5F9629C07BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064202014:1":{"text":"可是，大哥哥，你不是也没走吗？","source_cn":"可是，大哥哥，你不是也没走吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C2B7C83C5A63ECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064202015:1":{"text":"能逃跑的人，都离开了。你不和他们一起吗？","source_cn":"能逃跑的人，都离开了。你不和他们一起吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DBA730FE4063E7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064202016:1":{"text":"逃跑？不，不对……我不能跑……","source_cn":"逃跑？不，不对……我不能跑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75577CBFFA0FCC2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064202017:1":{"text":"为什么？","source_cn":"为什么？<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7453A98B439BD3DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064202018:1":{"text":"我得和大家一起，杀了那些祸害世间的魔物！","source_cn":"我得和大家一起，杀了那些祸害世间的魔物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8363F290825EAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064202019:1":{"text":"杀魔物……？\n这种事，不是应该交给士兵，和魔法师吗。","source_cn":"杀魔物……？\\n这种事，不是应该交给士兵，和魔法师吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F5C1EE117F35DD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064202020:1":{"text":"你看不出来吗？我就是士兵啊！","source_cn":"你看不出来吗？我就是士兵啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF661C10357B3F31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064202021:1":{"text":"唔，你的确穿着士兵的衣服……","source_cn":"唔，你的确穿着士兵的衣服……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD05101ABCC2E8906","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064202022:1":{"text":"可是，这座村子离前线很远……你为什么会在这里睡觉？","source_cn":"可是，这座村子离前线很远……你为什么会在这里睡觉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8DEE268D4703C2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064202023:1":{"text":"别用那种眼神看我，我也不知道自己为什么会出现在这里……","source_cn":"别用那种眼神看我，我也不知道自己为什么会出现在这里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC345B389C60C49CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064202024:1":{"text":"噢吼？莫非说，你是逃兵？","source_cn":"噢吼？莫非说，你是逃兵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD95DEE8E05C89A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064202025:1":{"text":"……谁？！谁在说话？！","source_cn":"……谁？！谁在说话？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8CD2764EEF0236E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064202026:1":{"text":"有、有人说话吗？我没听到……","source_cn":"有、有人说话吗？我没听到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70AAECE1582B2350","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064202027:0":{"text":"大哥哥，你太紧张了……是不是把树梢上的鸟鸣听错了？","source_cn":"大哥哥，你太紧张了……是不是把树梢上的鸟鸣听错了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x805377548B33AE3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064202028:0":{"text":"这地方哪还有几只鸟？总之，我——","source_cn":"这地方哪还有几只鸟？总之，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BDB52A7E09636CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064202029:1":{"text":"——砰！","source_cn":"——砰！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB67C58F9D43C40EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064202030:0":{"text":"伴随着巨大的爆炸声，刺目的火红从天边飞起。如同惊雷的声音令埃因不由自主地瑟缩、颤抖起来。","source_cn":"伴随着巨大的爆炸声，刺目的火红从天边飞起。如同惊雷的声...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1140E2E847C22EB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064202031:0":{"text":"同样昏沉的夜晚和可怖的袭击，构成了他对于战场的最后记忆。那时他没能救下迈克尔，而他的生命也陪伴战友坠入黑暗，再也迎不来和煦的晨光。","source_cn":"同样昏沉的夜晚和可怖的袭击，构成了他对于战场的最后记忆...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE160F4DC9585322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064202032:0":{"text":"大哥哥……没事的，别害怕……","source_cn":"大哥哥……没事的，别害怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D2D003E3C066BA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064202033:0":{"text":"我、我没有害怕……<shk>我不是逃兵！！</shk>","source_cn":"我、我没有害怕……<shk>我不是逃兵！！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x894FF45195E94EA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064202034:0":{"text":"我知道……你不是逃兵，你战斗到了最后一刻。","source_cn":"我知道……你不是逃兵，你战斗到了最后一刻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD436DB11FE34BE68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064202035:0":{"text":"大家都知道……艾雅女神，也知道。","source_cn":"大家都知道……艾雅女神，也知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99C3BA298CE953C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064202036:0":{"text":"埃因恍惚地望着她，有那么一瞬间，她的身影竟与艾雅女神的雕像重合起来。","source_cn":"埃因恍惚地望着她，有那么一瞬间，她的身影竟与艾雅女神的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAB06E336D5A11ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064202037:0":{"text":"但是……但是战争还没有结束，最后一刻还没有来临……我得回去支援大家！","source_cn":"但是……但是战争还没有结束，最后一刻还没有来临……我得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B65F465E282917E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064202038:0":{"text":"……不，不行。不能把你独自留在这里。战火蔓延的速度很快，我得先把你送到安全的地方。","source_cn":"……不，不行。不能把你独自留在这里。战火蔓延的速度很快...","status":"matched","hash_